    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's just more than just a feeling. it's the reality of it. she's working harder, she's more tired, she's missing out on things because she's constantly checking on me or helping me. even when i'm just sitting there, i feel like i'm taking something away from her life. like, if i wasn't here, she could finally just... breathe. she could be her own person again instead of a caregiver.",
